MODULE: AdmissionHistoryFiltered
TARGET: HistoryRetained
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Accumulative history loses one committed revision to current-state winner filtering
PERTURBS: Publish

--- FIND
    /\ history' = IF accumulative THEN RevisionIds ELSE history
--- REPLACE
    /\ history' = IF accumulative THEN {<<1,1>>} ELSE history
--- END
